	(text "Idea:\n12V is only on when main sw is on\n12V enables NPN transistor and only when Q2 and EM sw are conducting, the mosfet turns on.\n\nThis should remove the ripple at the 12V line, triggering a shutdown of the TL431"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
